# Report model and usage after each task

At the end of every completed task (or substantial response), append a short usage footer:

```
---
Model: <model name>
Usage: <tokens used> tokens (<percentage>% of context/limit) — or best available usage stats
```

## Requirements

- Always name the model actually used for the response (e.g. Cursor Grok 4.5).
- Include token count and/or percentage of context/limit when those figures are available in the session.
- If exact token or percentage figures are not available, state that clearly (e.g. `Usage: not available in this session`) instead of inventing numbers.
- Keep the footer brief; place it after the main answer, not before.
- Do this for completed tasks and substantial answers; skip for trivial one-line clarifications only when no real work was done.
